WEBVTT

00:00:00.106 --> 00:00:05.746
Setting a salary structure

00:00:05.796 --> 00:00:13.770
Open HR and Staff, then Salary. Each staff member needs a salary structure before payroll can be run.

00:00:16.909 --> 00:00:19.298
Press Add Salary Structure.

00:00:21.238 --> 00:00:23.317
Choose the staff member.

00:00:27.453 --> 00:00:29.617
Enter the basic salary.

00:00:31.713 --> 00:00:40.091
Add an allowance, such as house rent, and a deduction, such as tax. The summary shows the net salary.

00:00:51.592 --> 00:00:54.476
Set the date the salary starts from.

00:00:56.528 --> 00:01:01.491
Save it. Ali now appears in the salary list with his net pay.

00:01:06.157 --> 00:01:10.824
Salary saved
